{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_2_002sht_01_1_2_002_01",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:7301b95c7282804360f2eab1e51d3d96d96adf689905edc7ddb2e91babc72c96",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_2_002sht_01_1_2_002_01:1_2_002_01_a:cmd-000000:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fcac364175ea5172cb4ff83a476e7493e63cc633a4f17891f348a1cec394bc36",
      "text": "我果然擅长被人宠爱呢♪",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_002sht_01_1_2_002_01:1_2_002_01_a:cmd-000000:synopsis:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:79c57dd9bc280573bd3abac1dc063ad6b1354674d17100d8840c9eff92b14959",
      "text": "翔太决定出演一档从家人口中听取童年轶事、\n并结合照片等内容畅谈的节目。\n为此，他向家人打听了各种回忆故事，\n并收集起小时候的照片。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_002sht_01_1_2_002_01:1_2_002_01_a:cmd-000010:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7824b3a8948acd2c72636875e79b09adab6d8fca3c20b65cfcfd68e8d3eae4ba",
      "text": "第1话",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_002sht_01_1_2_002_01:1_2_002_01_a:cmd-000010:title:001": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fcac364175ea5172cb4ff83a476e7493e63cc633a4f17891f348a1cec394bc36",
      "text": "我果然擅长被人宠爱呢♪",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_002sht_01_1_2_002_01:1_2_002_01_a:cmd-000019:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bb83259120c374985bc13ec80de748b6f9e458c9f6ef39fcb093cb956d861323",
      "text": "制作人！\n下次的工作是什么样的？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_002sht_01_1_2_002_01:1_2_002_01_a:cmd-000023:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c4752102a8e226e9102cd743b19306fa2c4a801b231bc00ba2535f8c8d82a16d",
      "text": "是一档结合家人提供的照片与家庭录像，\n讲述童年轶事的节目。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_002sht_01_1_2_002_01:1_2_002_01_a:cmd-000025:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:41327bcb5e65e4bc76e017000cc0a70f4f0836c42c691de2beb36fcb2a8e9044",
      "text": "希望翔太先生能向家人打听一些故事，\n并向家人转达出演节目相关的通知。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_002sht_01_1_2_002_01:1_2_002_01_a:cmd-000030:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1b88864f3db77d4919e9ae55afdcb49b151e0d591f810ce3fb220b212d7ae7f2",
      "text": "参与出演的人员，\n由我来另外进行详细说明。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_002sht_01_1_2_002_01:1_2_002_01_a:cmd-000034:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:92a065db83a15c65c8e0cb51a980af4b1ea7d78ddd906d7e9cd7c806c819f7ec",
      "text": "哇～！听起来好有趣！\n我知道了！这就去问问看。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_002sht_01_1_2_002_01:1_2_002_01_a:cmd-000038:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6f6a0fa1c22ca1b4c71304d6868613f880587cd55973b90bb908d1f57e061233",
      "text": "电视机前的大家说不定会被我小时候的可爱模样\n迷得神魂颠倒呢！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_002sht_01_1_2_002_01:1_2_002_01_a:cmd-000043:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6dd405c1ed1ba1bbea5d803b6b5c8236804d0e40de1a5eb3ae73447a976b15b5",
      "text": "我也很期待看到翔太先生小时候的照片呢！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_002sht_01_1_2_002_01:1_2_002_01_a:cmd-000047:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d70af1240375237806de8e83b83eff9d35c52ef28e8ac83b8f078729887670a5",
      "text": "照片和录像都有好多好多，\n你就好好期待吧♪",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_002sht_01_1_2_002_01:1_2_002_01_a:cmd-000053:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0c1642d8ede2878b2225c5caa422a4480180f3b6f1bb27cc76c80ee5407c7aea",
      "text": "有趣的故事肯定也有很多！\n姐姐们经常说的就是……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_002sht_01_1_2_002_01:1_2_002_01_a:cmd-000060:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6a8e241b8bb4227171ddd48cb51d3201cbe6566dd88028b4b2e734dcb7d9963a",
      "text": "哎呀，这个还是留到下次当惊喜比较好呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_002sht_01_1_2_002_01:1_2_002_01_a:cmd-000064:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:85ac62be460be2d4e0bdfa72d3c829256bf71597561bbd79408cac670b1d08b0",
      "text": "那，我回去问问大家看喽～。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_002sht_01_1_2_002_01:1_2_002_01_b:cmd-000014:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:275508181548edd14fe0ff29d556b3d8ca2600b9839a18c6653d4d2698068c27",
      "text": "翔太家中·客厅",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_002sht_01_1_2_002_01:1_2_002_01_b:cmd-000022:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:19d37282aaab39532f5bf26d6c862860ced13abb8ff4a5943af48315a69c44b6",
      "text": "喂喂，我有点事想问一下……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_002sht_01_1_2_002_01:1_2_002_01_b:cmd-000032:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:94c47e71a7f809652716c93dcac4901345742e2813115851d14db6b4d4bcc329",
      "text": "几分钟后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_002sht_01_1_2_002_01:1_2_002_01_b:cmd-000039:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a2327730537d4f65f3886b62a71c016f51de6390fd9801c6ec8a93cb8a814a70",
      "text": "……事情就是这样，\n有什么有趣的故事吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_002sht_01_1_2_002_01:1_2_002_01_b:cmd-000043:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cddf41d74eebd5194bf6da75cc83165f750ec78194a1ecf535a9365b69b4f5fa",
      "text": "原来如此！\n有啊有啊！稍等一下！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_002sht_01_1_2_002_01:1_2_002_01_b:cmd-000057:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0b0370e8c93b6b40e604f62c568b7e260c9432f17daebc9bbe1c09c50833ec5f",
      "text": "让你久等了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_002sht_01_1_2_002_01:1_2_002_01_b:cmd-000065:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:45bd54e4142c715b03c4a22eb7a15533fc7b4d73f2c557c85e8de3aa7bd042ee",
      "text": "哇，好惊人的量！\n这些全都是我的！？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_002sht_01_1_2_002_01:1_2_002_01_b:cmd-000071:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bac0328d6e86a63f3f2a244e62ea080248f528229abce26dc647020f9f5fd056",
      "text": "对呀对呀！这是翔太上幼儿园开学典礼时的照片，\n哭着说不想和妈妈分开……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_002sht_01_1_2_002_01:1_2_002_01_b:cmd-000078:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:06043010416e2eea498385e85ca6c53467f9040260e190b5e196d393efec85c7",
      "text": "这张是运动会赛跑拿了第一名的照片！\n得意地比着V字手势的样子超可爱的！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_002sht_01_1_2_002_01:1_2_002_01_b:cmd-000084:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:54290808a3e3c1b396c2e16f2fb30f6867b432b72e872ca49eb13fcaa3e944b0",
      "text": "我回来啦～。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_002sht_01_1_2_002_01:1_2_002_01_b:cmd-000088:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:64d16c1ed2f8ea2f9763677b8341c747170fa45f1a7908bce95f9a8088cd5ac5",
      "text": "我回来了。\n刚才正好在门口遇到妈妈了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_002sht_01_1_2_002_01:1_2_002_01_b:cmd-000094:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0e8599dc79fa43b2c3bdcc80425cb189d9126f8794a8352d736b6e34317baa1a",
      "text": "啊！大姐和妈妈回来了！\n快来听听，翔太他……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_002sht_01_1_2_002_01:1_2_002_01_b:cmd-000106:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bfd7bc69c5545564008d27820ce5e7122360c4551c61b3b8f51025ff402c8829",
      "text": "啊，等一下……\n啊哈哈，感觉要变得热闹起来了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_002sht_01_1_2_002_01:1_2_002_01_c:cmd-000017:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:69a50a1329fc5dc7b808d02ff0d32d9b8da503e32dd0914ec1c7c7afcbabafdd",
      "text": "这是5岁时的翔太！\n全家人一起去摘苹果时的照片。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_002sht_01_1_2_002_01:1_2_002_01_c:cmd-000021:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f03c95e5d4f15e0d1c643191dda6a7eaaeb794398367bd621d1d83456f0de2b4",
      "text": "是翔太用小小的手\n摘苹果时的照片……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_002sht_01_1_2_002_01:1_2_002_01_c:cmd-000036:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d97839694a88d3dbaae2835aa42718463b83dd8670118274c73ca9eac5ddd44c",
      "text": "事务所",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_002sht_01_1_2_002_01:1_2_002_01_c:cmd-000041:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:71a4407baf9b4f73178d09ad8e9aebb6eed29d7f7c65274a85e4abe033910abd",
      "text": "能深深感受到翔太先生非常受家人的宠爱呢！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_002sht_01_1_2_002_01:1_2_002_01_c:cmd-000045:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:025f56806326236a7fabe2d92229e26c8f8b5d73b5bb29b0c98942218f24ee46",
      "text": "嘿嘿那是当然！\n因为我很可爱嘛♪",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_002sht_01_1_2_002_01:1_2_002_01_c:cmd-000049:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b0911ae13c95db0b24c815129583279429e50e0560c0760b0811c1c365e95a82",
      "text": "演播室里的大家，\n也全都被我小时候的样子给俘虏了呢！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_002sht_01_1_2_002_01:1_2_002_01_c:cmd-000052:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:33bb2d717626cc72f5056031e3a36df45f0d031b5ba52c7942718955c093c1d0",
      "text": "是的。全都是些非常棒的照片和录像。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_002sht_01_1_2_002_01:1_2_002_01_c:cmd-000057:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6b52482244218fdbcad09361e3762527712f5d435c3a9d81fb950e0531c5c915",
      "text": "听到制作人这么说，\n真开心～",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_002sht_01_1_2_002_01:1_2_002_01_c:cmd-000062:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:da2c55ffeea9e00973a808f620b5a6afdab7312aa6eef38e250d4c732743524d",
      "text": "话说回来，要在这么多的照片里\n挑出来还真是辛苦呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_002sht_01_1_2_002_01:1_2_002_01_c:cmd-000068:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:825d8eff261a786b2350cfffe7a27b1213af8e7ce6dfdcdc5e1ac8210b026408",
      "text": "我明明说了带太多会让制作人很为难的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_002sht_01_1_2_002_01:1_2_002_01_c:cmd-000074:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e88a4551f46eaec3e056dc8b302689c049cfb07bba103131c56f227607a5b0e3",
      "text": "结果大家这个也觉得好那个也觉得好，\n拿来了好多好多！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_002sht_01_1_2_002_01:1_2_002_01_d:cmd-000012:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f6ff08f433d91a7a5a0239eb58ced46bdfbbbca28c210329c88c6c9c97803ac8",
      "text": "这次没能公开的照片里，\n也有很多非常棒的呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_002sht_01_1_2_002_01:1_2_002_01_d:cmd-000020:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9a234868a1c2b9cc95be759a827908d77faab6dbe613b7fca4afe0a53e26b756",
      "text": "就是说嘛。……那我来代替照片，\n讲给制作人听吧♪",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_002sht_01_1_2_002_01:1_2_002_01_d:cmd-000030:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:035bb069c9dccdf42f7f358c8da384f72f5354754785681973084e8805b15752",
      "text": "这是万圣节扮成床单幽灵时的照片！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_002sht_01_1_2_002_01:1_2_002_01_d:cmd-000042:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3d699dffebec3a7061ed838fd8d7a2aa813f90d56bb5c0ba1c58309615e8227a",
      "text": "恶作剧超开心的。\n从阴影里“哇！”……这样跳出来吓人。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_002sht_01_1_2_002_01:1_2_002_01_d:cmd-000044:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c7add148e62632bf54e32e206330eb132ef1d3415e4fdba86342fb543cb82d86",
      "text": "结果，把二姐给吓哭了呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_002sht_01_1_2_002_01:1_2_002_01_d:cmd-000055:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:985b464a21c14a2d5e94dbff306543cbd1544b778ad6c2d44f15ee6d326a13e3",
      "text": "这张照片是……圣诞节呢。\n看，有圣诞树对吧？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_002sht_01_1_2_002_01:1_2_002_01_d:cmd-000062:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:00cd2b862fc729cece5b7071cc8adaede334351acfd210cb42deb96b8536689f",
      "text": "那一年我记得……好像收到了桌游当礼物。\n起床之后大家就一起玩了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_002sht_01_1_2_002_01:1_2_002_01_d:cmd-000067:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2cb6896b4ae292139ee32593f7fc4401147371e9e06b2503cfe66aa2b3c1c244",
      "text": "大姐可厉害了。\n完全不手下留情的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_002sht_01_1_2_002_01:1_2_002_01_d:cmd-000073:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bc1c0ba4809343aa636642b77cc25519b567cd54688c28fefba8c5df9de9f553",
      "text": "一直比试到赢为止……\n赢了的时候超级开心呢♪",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_002sht_01_1_2_002_01:1_2_002_01_d:cmd-000077:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9cb1840a5693d16de40c6136f1bbe17d1252eca27ff9d8a5eef50f9e7526b242",
      "text": "真是美好的回忆呢！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_002sht_01_1_2_002_01:1_2_002_01_e:cmd-000015:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:21e16c263c0ccd23d94910f72cda5dd5472f7aa39b773df75c572774c8132c11",
      "text": "话说回来，跟姐姐们提起这次工作的时候\n可真是折腾了一番呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_002sht_01_1_2_002_01:1_2_002_01_e:cmd-000021:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a3be06cf4e08c326d098895979af21ae224b60d5fe2b1fe14679c5a37ff97d85",
      "text": "大家一个个都喊着想讲那个故事！想上电视！\n根本不听人说话！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_002sht_01_1_2_002_01:1_2_002_01_e:cmd-000024:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a0f4229e95e85ae05e05f8d5ad422adef87d9659e8946347fa17d976b0bdeda9",
      "text": "大家都太想上电视了啦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_002sht_01_1_2_002_01:1_2_002_01_e:cmd-000026:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:052b54e54272f94a5b6bf258f65768677456999b907a135dfe5ecde2da341add",
      "text": "翔太先生很受家人的疼爱呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_002sht_01_1_2_002_01:1_2_002_01_e:cmd-000029:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4d7cce13c19e84285446363fbf059260cbb0993da606ab4ce2a1e22e3eb3c778",
      "text": "要不是非常喜欢翔太先生，\n也不会拿出这么多的照片和故事呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_002sht_01_1_2_002_01:1_2_002_01_e:cmd-000034:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9f6d1b9805032298ad4d55c833bbf291d709c7402d21d78f473ef9e0a8af212f",
      "text": "嘿嘿，算是吧。\n因为我就是这么受大家喜爱嘛！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_002sht_01_1_2_002_01:1_2_002_01_e:cmd-000038:dialogue:000": {
